  "answer_text": "The next NBA game is **Game 1 of the 2026 NBA Finals** between the **San Antonio Spurs** and the **New York Knicks**, taking place on **Wednesday, June 3, 2026**, at the Frost Bank Center in San Antonio, Texas. \n\nBecause this is the NBA Finals, tickets are highly sought after and expensive. You can secure tickets through several official and verified resale channels:\n\n### 1. Official & Primary Ticketing\n* **San Antonio Spurs Home Games (Games 1, 2, and if necessary, 5 & 7):**\n  * **Spurs.com / Ticketmaster:** Ticketmaster is the official ticketing partner for the NBA and the San Antonio Spurs. You can purchase standard admission and verified resale tickets directly through the Spurs\u2019 official website or Ticketmaster. \n  * *Note on Restrictions:* To prevent out-of-market scalping, the Spurs have implemented a restriction requiring primary buyers to live within **150 miles** of the Frost Bank Center (verified by the billing zip code of your payment method).\n* **New York Knicks Home Games (Games 3, 4, and if necessary, 6):**\n  * **Knicks.com / Madison Square Garden (MSG):** For games held at Madison Square Garden in New York City, tickets can be accessed via the Knicks' official website or the MSG box office via Ticketmaster. \n\n### 2. Secondary & Resale Marketplaces\nIf primary tickets are sold out or you do not meet the geographic purchasing requirements for primary tickets, you can find tickets on major verified resale platforms. While prices are steep (with get-in prices starting at over $1,000 for the upper bowl), these platforms offer buyer guarantees:\n* **StubHub**\n* **SeatGeek**\n* **Vivid Seats**\n\n### Tips for Buying Finals Tickets:\n* **Verify the Seller:** Only buy from official partners (Ticketmaster) or reputable secondary marketplaces with 100% buyer guarantees (StubHub, SeatGeek, etc.) to avoid counterfeit tickets.\n* **Watch out for \"If Necessary\" Games:** Games 5, 6, and 7 are conditionally scheduled. If you buy tickets for these games and they do not end up being played, you will be automatically refunded by the official ticketing platform.",
